;; the ninth statutory objective is carried as "ปฏิบัติกิจการอื่น ๆ" and not as
;; the full clause, because the full clause has a newline escape in the middle
;; of it and would report a missing page when the page is fine.
;;
;; `:next-data-count` is for claims that are about a number of things rather
;; than about a sentence. "Nine statutory objectives" cannot be evidenced by a
;; substring — the page never writes the digit 9 — so it is evidenced by the
;; length of the list the page serves. Without this the entry would say nine
;; and nothing would check it.
